---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../site';
---

<Base
  title="Teaching"
  description="Quddusia Azam taught English from 1992, for three decades, from class prep through class 10. She holds a B.Ed. and an M.A."
>
  <h1 class="page-title">Teaching</h1>
  <hr class="rule" />
  <section class="block">
    <h2>The classroom</h2>
    <p>
      For three decades Quddusia Azam taught English to schoolchildren. She began in 1992 with a prep class. The heart
      of the work was classes 3, 4, and 5, children of about eight to eleven, and she taught up to class 10, about age
      sixteen. She had wanted to be a doctor. Teaching became the work of her life.
    </p>
    <blockquote class="mantra">
      <p>If the students love you, they will automatically love your subject.</p>
    </blockquote>
    <p>
      She has written about those years in <a href="/writing/the-last-two-days">The last two days</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="block">
    <h2>Studies</h2>
    <p>She holds a B.Ed. and an M.A.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="block">
    <h2>In public</h2>
    <p>
      In 2020 she appeared in <em>#ThankYouTeachers</em>, a film made for Nihar Shanti Amla by BBH India and directed by
      Niyantha Shekar. It was a portrait of teachers learning to take the classroom online.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href={site.film} rel="noopener noreferrer">Watch the film</a><br />
      <a href={site.filmCredit} rel="noopener noreferrer">Credits and stills</a>
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="block">
    <h2>An invitation</h2>
    <p>
      She has recently retired, and she is glad to be invited to teach. A note can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>, or through her <a href={site.facebook}>Facebook page</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
